msgid "Using bmaptool"
msgstr "使用bmap-tools"

#, fuzzy
msgid "One way to prepare an SD card is using `bmaptool <https://github.com/yoctoproject/bmaptool>`_. Yocto automatically creates a block map file (``<IMAGENAME>-<MACHINE>.wic.bmap``) for the WIC image that describes the image content and includes checksums for data integrity. *bmaptool* is packaged by various Linux distributions. For Debian-based systems install it by issuing:"
